#### Step 1: Add actuals fetch to CosSummaryBar

CosSummaryBar currently receives only `project` prop. Change it to also fetch actuals when `project.status === "wip" || project.status === "scoping"` and `project.ft_project_name` is set.

Add inside CosSummaryBar (after existing useState/calc):
```tsx
